5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The current system is failing. We need a sustainable structure for the next year.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am concerned about the time commitment. We need to understand the actual workload.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The current distribution feels uneven. I want to see where the usage and work align.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I am tired of guessing the state of the rooms. I want predictability.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I care most about keeping our relationships intact. We need a solution that preserves harmony.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, time is a factor, but so is cost. We need to look at both.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, if we don't know the hours, we can't plan. I will look into timing.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the calendar to see who is actually here to do the work.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I will look at what we consider ""done"" to stop the back-and-forth.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I will read the note from the previous tenants to see what went wrong for them.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the receipts to see what we are actually spending on supplies.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also look at the management office rates to see if outsourcing is viable.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will watch the kitchen for a fortnight to see who is using it most.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I will check the bathroom grout status to understand the maintenance cycle.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will review the house chat logs to see what triggers our conflicts.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
