35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The receipts show we spend 2,300 yen monthly on supplies, often buying duplicates.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,A full pass takes 102 minutes. The outside firm requires someone to be home to tidy first.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Two people are away most months. The kitchen mess comes from just two or three of us.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"""Done"" means different things to everyone. The grout gets dirty again in eleven days.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,The previous tenants split rooms permanently and stopped speaking by year two. Our rows start with reminders.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, if the firm needs someone home, that doesn't save us the time, just the labor.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, it saves the physical labor. But 102 minutes is a lot to lose if we do it ourselves.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"If only two or three of us cook, why are all five of us responsible for the kitchen?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,The grout issue means the bathroom is never truly clean. It's a constant battle.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, that is a fair point. But if we split rooms, we risk the previous tenants' fate.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"The management office charges 4,200 yen an hour. That is expensive for 102 minutes of work.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"4,200 yen is 42,840 yen for a full pass. That is a significant monthly cost.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"If we pay for a service, we need to ensure the invoice is split fairly based on usage.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,I would prefer a service if it means I don't have to guess the state of the bathroom.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,A service might remove the friction of reminders. But we need to be sure we can afford it.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
