60,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option A is permanent ownership. Option B is a paid service. Option C is a weekly rota.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option B seems to remove the time burden, but the cost is high.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option C allows for rotation, but it doesn't account for absences or usage differences.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,Option A feels risky given the previous tenants' experience. Option B offers predictability.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Midori,,Option B might preserve our relationships by removing the source of conflict.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, the cost of B is high, but the cost of our time is also high.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, true. But 42,840 yen is a lot. We need to be sure it's worth it.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Option C is the cheapest, but it relies on everyone being present and willing.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,I am leaning towards B. I want to stop guessing.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Midori,,I am also leaning towards B. I want to keep us on speaking terms.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"I will vote for B. It solves the cost and time issues, even if it is expensive.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I will vote for B. It removes the time burden, which is my main concern.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I will vote for C. It is cheaper and allows for some flexibility, even if imperfect.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,I will vote for B. I want predictability and to stop the bathroom anxiety.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Midori,,I will vote for B. I want to preserve our harmony.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
